<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>this macro helps you to go up the zipline way faster than normal. Just simply stand infront of the zipline until you are able ot interact with it. Then press the chosen hotkey and let it do its thing. I recocmend to chose a hotkey you dont normally use ingame. Make sure that "scroll wheel up" is "move forward",  "scroll wheel down" is jump" and "interact" is "E". Practice it in the "shooting Range" first before playing "ranked" or "pubs".
Game resolution: fullscreen, 16:10 ratio, 1920:1200
Sensitivity: 1600-1800 dpi, 0.8 ingame
Enjoy!
</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
